# Visit Booking Workflow — Full Redesign

## Overview

Redesign the booking flow from a simple "click and confirm" model to a **multi-step, payment-verified, admin-moderated** workflow with WhatsApp integration.

---

## New Workflow (Step by Step)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student
    participant P as Platform
    participant A as Admin
    participant B as Broker

    S->>P: 1. Browse properties & choose listing type
    S->>P: 2. Select visit date/time
    P->>S: 3. Show InstaPay link + 100 EGP deposit info
    S->>P: 4. Upload payment screenshot
    P->>A: 5. Notification: new visit request + screenshot
    A->>A: 6. Verify payment screenshot
    alt Payment OK
        A->>P: 7a. Approve → status: admin_approved
        P->>B: 8. Notify broker (platform + WhatsApp)
        B->>P: 9. Accept visit → status: confirmed
        P->>S: 10. WhatsApp confirmation to student
    else Payment Bad
        A->>P: 7b. Reject → status: payment_rejected
        P->>S: Notify student to re-upload
    end
```

---

## Visit Status Flow

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `awaiting_payment` | Student created request, hasn't uploaded screenshot yet |
| `payment_uploaded` | Student uploaded screenshot, waiting for admin |
| `admin_approved` | Admin verified payment, forwarded to broker |
| `payment_rejected` | Admin rejected the screenshot |
| `confirmed` | Broker accepted the visit |
| `completed` | Visit done |
| `cancelled` | Cancelled by student/broker |
| `no_show` | Student didn't show up |

