## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Database Schema Changes

#### [MODIFY] `supabase_schema.sql` + Run SQL in Supabase
- **Alter `visits` table**:
  - Add `payment_screenshot_url` (text, nullable) — stores uploaded screenshot
  - Change `booking_fee` default from 50 to 100
  - Expand `status` check constraint to include the new statuses: `awaiting_payment`, `payment_uploaded`, `admin_approved`, `payment_rejected`
  - Add `admin_notes` (text, nullable) — admin can leave a note when rejecting payment
  - Add `instapay_ref` (text, nullable) — optional InstaPay reference number from student

> [!IMPORTANT]
> SQL to run in Supabase:
> ```sql
> ALTER TABLE visits DROP CONSTRAINT IF EXISTS visits_status_check;
> ALTER TABLE visits ADD CONSTRAINT visits_status_check 
>   CHECK (status IN ('awaiting_payment','payment_uploaded','admin_approved','payment_rejected','pending','confirmed','completed','cancelled','no_show'));
> ALTER TABLE visits ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS payment_screenshot_url text;
> ALTER TABLE visits ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS admin_notes text;
> ALTER TABLE visits ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS instapay_ref text;
> ALTER TABLE visits ALTER COLUMN booking_fee SET DEFAULT 100;
> ```

