### Phase 6: WhatsApp Integration

#### How it works
We use **WhatsApp Click-to-Chat URLs** (`https://wa.me/{phone}?text={message}`). This opens WhatsApp on the admin's phone with a pre-filled message. No API key needed.

**When admin approves payment:**
→ Open `https://wa.me/{broker_phone}?text=مرحبًا, عندك طلب زيارة جديد...` with all the visit details.

**When broker confirms visit:**
→ Open `https://wa.me/{student_phone}?text=تم تأكيد زيارتك...` with visit details.

> [!NOTE]
> This approach uses "click-to-chat" links, not a WhatsApp Business API. The admin/broker clicks the link and WhatsApp opens with the message pre-filled. This is free and requires no API key. If you want fully automated messages (no click needed), we would need the WhatsApp Business API which costs money.

